'''Eric Cross Brooks''' is a famous [[vampires|vampire]] hunter and [[Resistance]] member known as '''Blade'''.

==Biography==
{{Rewrite}}
===Early Life===
{{Quote|The [[TVA]] decided our [[Universe Defender Blade|universe]] was dying, and I never got a chance to fight for it.|Blade|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
Blade operated as a [[Vampires|vampire]] hunter and as his [[Universe Defender Blade|world]] was dying, the [[Time Variance Authority]] sent him to the [[Void]] and denied him the chance to fight for it. There, he joined the [[Resistance]] who opposed the rule of oppresive [[Cassandra Nova]].{{Ref|DW}}

===Meeting Deadpool===
{{Quote|I was not expecting to see you here. Thought you were, you know, retired."<br>"Retarded?|[[Deadpool]] and Blade|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
Some time later, he met [[Deadpool]] and [[Wolverine]] who did the impossible and escaped Nova's layer alive. Blade and the other resistance members also learned that [[Human Torch]] was killed by Cassandra. Deadpool successfully convinced Blade and the others to invade [[Cassandra Nova's Compound]] and take her down using [[Juggernaut|Juggernaut's]] [[Juggernaut's Helmet|helmet]] to block her powers.{{Ref|DW}}

===[[Attack on Cassandra Nova's Compound|Getting an Ending]]===
{{Quote|Some motherfuckers still trying to ice skate uphill.|Blade|Deadpool & Wolverine}}
Using [[Nicepool|Nicepool's]] {{WPS|Honda Odyssey (North America)|Honda Odyssey}}, [[Ol' Betsy]], Blade traveled with the Resistance to the compound and used [[Punisher/Resistant Punisher|Punisher]]'s {{WPS|AT4|AT4 Rocket Launcher}} to break into their base. Blade and the Resistance held off [[Cassandra Nova's Henchmen|Nova's forces]] as Deadpool and Wolverine went off to confront Nova while [[X-23|X-23]] secured the helmet. Later in the battle as [[Alioth]] approached the compound, Blade witnessed [[Deadpool]] and [[Wolverine]] jump into a [[Inter-Dimensional Portal]] created by Cassandra who gave the duo a way home after they saved her life from [[Pyro]]. He was later returned to his home reality by the [[Time Variance Authority]] at Deadpool's request.{{Ref|DW}}

