==Equipment==
*'''[[Blade's Sword|Sword]]''': Blade carries a sword that he uses in combat, notably using it during the [[Attack on Cassandra Nova's Compound]].
*'''Knife''': Blade carries a knife the size of a Bowie knife, which he is able to easily use in close quarters combat.
*'''Glaive''': Blade utilized a boomerang styled throwing weapon called a glaive, which he used against the likes of [[Toad]], using it to slice off his tongue before stabbing him in the head with it.
*'''Stake Pistol''': Blade carries a pistol on his hip, which is designed to fire silver stakes, ideal for both killing vampires and pinning other foes to the wall.

